      "kind": "chapter",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Lock a document with a password"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "Documents share by URL. To gate one, its owner switches the access mode to password-protected and chooses a passphrase. Visitors hit a blocking dialog before they see anything; only the right passphrase gets them past it. Only the owner sees the access-mode picker: sign in first, because a document created without an account has no owner and can't be locked.",
      "file": "01.webp",
      "cursor": {
        "x": 640,
        "y": 26
      },
      "path": "/d/FT-oh8nsQV"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "Open the share dialog from the lock icon in the topbar.",
      "file": "01.webp",
      "cursor": {
        "x": 640,
        "y": 26
      },
      "path": "/d/FT-oh8nsQV"
    },
    {
