      "text": "What your visitor sees"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "A first-time visitor: say, in their own browser, opens the link and gets the password dialog first. Until the passphrase checks out, markoto sends them nothing of the document: not the text, not even its title.",
